        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marshals of Yore is a different and simpler approach to classical RTS. It's easy to play, yet challenging. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/78ab42308cafa5e4343b8bab7dfbc246.avif?t=1782127012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ perks to choose from during battle to finesse your build. Even a common perk can be crucial for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/4b06bbdee25384295353fc6f3ccbb896.avif?t=1782127012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your army by picking a marshal, equipping items, selecting a background and spell. There are so many variations to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/bb8881eac0c6bb4288faee4dc86ee461.avif?t=1782127012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your units for coming battles; the enemy gets stronger every stage. And let's not forget, you will need all the help for the endless mode!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marshals of Yore is a different and simpler approach to classical RTS. It's easy to play, yet challenging. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/78ab42308cafa5e4343b8bab7dfbc246.avif?t=1782127012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ perks to choose from during battle to finesse your build. Even a common perk can be crucial for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/4b06bbdee25384295353fc6f3ccbb896.avif?t=1782127012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your army by picking a marshal, equipping items, selecting a background and spell. There are so many variations to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868490/extras/bb8881eac0c6bb4288faee4dc86ee461.avif?t=1782127012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your units for coming battles; the enemy gets stronger every stage. And let's not forget, you will need all the help for the endless mode!</p>",
        "short_description": "Marshals of Yore is an auto-battler with old-school RTS features. It’s easy to learn and play. Three distinct factions with unique units, marshals, and playstyles. Customize your army, unlock marshals, upgrade your units, and equip powerful items to unleash devastating synergies across 135 stages.",
        "supported_languages": "English, Turkish",
        "reviews": "“And it's fun. It's fun watching these little gadgies charge over to destroy the portals of the enemy. It's really good fun.”<br>Worth a Buy – Worth a Buy<br>",
